# Agent ops

**GitHub:** the sandbox cannot use macOS `SSH_AUTH_SOCK`. Origin is `git@github.com`, so a sandboxed `git push`/`fetch`/`pull`/`ls-remote` fails `Permission denied (publickey)`. The first Shell call that talks to GitHub (including `gh`) must set `required_permissions: ["all"]`. Do not retry sandboxed.

**Browser:** Prefer Cursor's Browser tab (`cursor-ide-browser`: navigate, lock, snapshot, click). Do not skip UI because login is Google OIDC. In development, `/login` has **Ambiente local** (`POST /dev/session`) for planted Accounts (`gutors@gmail.com` after `bin/rails db:seed`). Click one, then exercise the flow. Absent in production.

Use Playwright MCP only when the IDE tab cannot do the job: `<input type=file>`, iframe internals, the user asked for Playwright, or the IDE tab failed after one attempt. Do not open system Chrome (`open -a`, Computer Use) for app verification.
